{"id":"611163","name":"嫩南瓜熟肉炒米粉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/611163/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"嫩南瓜","amount":"50g"},{"name":"熟肉","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"半匙"},{"name":"白菜","amount":"小许"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"小许"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"小许"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"米粉洗净冷水下锅煮。","img":"images/611163/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切白菜和嫩南瓜。","img":"images/611163/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"取韭菜。","img":"images/611163/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切胡萝卜、洋葱和熟肉，吧肥肉单独放。","img":"images/611163/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮开锅的米粉，倒掉热水。","img":"images/611163/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"换冷水继续煮。","img":"images/611163/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/611163/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"油热放肥肉和食盐。","img":"images/611163/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把肥肉炒微黄放熟肉翻炒白菜等。","img":"images/611163/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"翻炒1分钟。","img":"images/611163/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"米粉开锅继续倒掉热水换了冷水煮开即可关火。","img":"images/611163/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放生抽。","img":"images/611163/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"炒均匀。","img":"images/611163/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放南瓜等。","img":"images/611163/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"翻炒至韭菜变色。","img":"images/611163/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入米粉和些许煮米粉的水。","img":"images/611163/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"翻炒。","img":"images/611163/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"大火炒至几乎没有汤汁即可。","img":"images/611163/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/611163/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}